---
const beliefs = [
  ['Problem before technology.', 'Start with what needs solving—not what technology happens to be fashionable.'],
  ['Depth before assumptions.', 'The better we understand a problem, the better we can understand what deserves to be built.'],
  ['Build to learn.', 'Ideas become useful when they meet reality.'],
  ['Outcomes over outputs.', 'What changes matters more than what we produce.'],
  ['Stay curious.', "The next important problem may come from somewhere we didn't expect."],
];
---

<main class="company-overview">
  <section class="company-hero">
    <div class="company-wrap">
      <p class="company-eyebrow">E DEVİSER / THE COMPANY</p>
      <div class="company-hero-grid">
        <h1>Built to solve<br /><em>what matters.</em></h1>
        <div class="company-hero-aside">
          <p>E Deviser is a problem-solving company built around a simple belief: important problems deserve the curiosity, depth, and determination to find better ways forward.</p>
          <a class="company-text-link" href="#why-we-exist">What drives us <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="company-hero-foot"><span>OUR APPROACH</span><p>Curiosity <i></i> Depth <i></i> Determination</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section company-founder" id="founder-story">
    <div class="company-wrap company-founder-grid">
      <div class="company-section-label"><p class="company-eyebrow">01 / THE BEGINNING</p><span>A conviction<br />to keep building.</span></div>
      <div class="company-section-copy">
        <p class="company-role">FOUNDER &amp; CEO</p>
        <h2>Understanding is<br /><em>only the beginning.</em></h2>
        <p>E Deviser began with a simple conviction: when a problem matters, understanding it deeply is only the beginning. We should be willing to build, test, learn, and keep going until we find something that works.</p>
        <p>That conviction continues to shape how we build the company today.</p>
        <a class="company-text-link" href="/company/team/">Meet the people behind the work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <small class="company-editorial-note">Founder name and full story will be added when approved details are available.</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section company-why" id="why-we-exist">
    <div class="company-wrap company-two-column">
      <div><p class="company-eyebrow">02 / WHY WE EXIST</p><h2>Some problems are<br /><em>worth going deeper for.</em></h2></div>
      <div class="company-body-copy">
        <p>We started E Deviser to build—not simply advise, observe, or wait for someone else to solve the difficult problems we care about.</p>
        <p>Meaningful progress comes from getting close to the problem, understanding what makes it difficult, bringing the right people and capabilities together, and having the courage to build something new.</p>
        <p class="company-pullquote">Get close to the problem. Bring the right capabilities. Make progress real.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section company-beliefs" id="beliefs">
    <div class="company-wrap">
      <div class="company-section-heading"><div><p class="company-eyebrow">03 / OUR BELIEFS</p><h2>Principles that shape<br /><em>the work.</em></h2></div><p>These beliefs guide how we decide what deserves our time, attention, and effort.</p></div>
      <div class="company-belief-list">
        {beliefs.map((belief) => <article class="company-belief"><h3>{belief[0]}</h3><p>{belief[1]}</p></article>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section company-culture" id="culture">
    <div class="company-wrap company-two-column">
      <div><p class="company-eyebrow">04 / HOW WE WORK</p><h2>Curious enough to question.<br /><em>Practical enough to build.</em></h2></div>
      <div class="company-body-copy"><p>We challenge assumptions, get close to the details, and stay open to changing our minds when the evidence tells us to.</p><p>We value people who can move between ideas and execution—people who don't just ask what is possible, but what is worth doing.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="company-wrap company-practice-line"><span>QUESTION ASSUMPTIONS</span><i></i><span>UNDERSTAND THE DETAILS</span><i></i><span>BUILD / LEARN / IMPROVE</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section company-future" id="looking-ahead">
    <div class="company-wrap company-two-column">
      <div><p class="company-eyebrow">05 / LOOKING AHEAD</p><h2>Small enough to stay curious.<br /><em>Ambitious enough to matter.</em></h2></div>
      <div class="company-body-copy"><p>E Deviser is still early. That's intentional.</p><p>We are building a company capable of going deep on difficult problems, developing new capabilities along the way, and carrying what we learn from one challenge into the next.</p><p>The company may evolve. The problems we work on may change. The technologies will certainly change.</p><strong>Our willingness to build will not.</strong></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section company-today" id="today">
    <div class="company-wrap company-today-grid">
      <div><p class="company-eyebrow">06 / WHERE WE ARE NOW</p><h2>Going deep on<br /><em>learning.</em></h2><p class="company-body-copy">Education is where we are currently applying our approach most deeply—because learning is consequential, complex, measurable, and capable of affecting millions of lives.</p><p class="company-body-copy">Cuevo is the first major expression of that commitment.</p><a class="company-text-link" href="/cuevo/">Explore Cuevo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <a class="company-cuevo-feature" href="/cuevo/" aria-label="Explore Cuevo"><span class="company-cuevo-overline">OUR FIRST MAJOR EXPRESSION</span><strong>CUEVO</strong><span class="company-cuevo-rule"></span><span class="company-cuevo-caption">A commitment to better learning <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-closing">
    <div class="company-wrap company-closing-inner"><p class="company-eyebrow">STILL BUILDING</p><h2>The problems will change.<br /><em>The ambition won't.</em></h2><div class="company-closing-bottom"><p>We are building E Deviser for the long term—one important problem, one real solution, and one lesson at a time.</p><div><a class="company-button" href="/company/team/">Meet the team <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="company-text-link" href="/company/careers-contact/">Talk to E Deviser <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div>
  </section>
</main>

<style>
.company-overview{background:var(--color-surface-raised);color:var(--color-text);overflow:hidden}.company-overview *{box-sizing:border-box}.company-wrap{width:min(var(--container-wide),calc(100% - 2*var(--gutter)));margin-inline:auto}
.company-eyebrow{margin:0 0 1.25rem;color:var(--primary-700);font:600 .68rem/1.5 var(--font-body);letter-spacing:.12em}
.company-hero{padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,9rem) 0 2.2rem;background:var(--color-surface-raised)}.company-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:clamp(2rem,8vw,9rem);align-items:end}.company-overview h1,.company-overview h2{margin:0;color:var(--color-text);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1.02;text-wrap:balance}.company-overview h1{font-size:clamp(3.8rem,8vw,8rem)}.company-overview h2{font-size:clamp(2.35rem,4.8vw,4.7rem)}.company-overview em{color:var(--brand-blue);font-style:normal}.company-hero-aside{max-width:27rem;padding-bottom:.5rem}.company-hero-aside>p,.company-body-copy{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:var(--text-body-large);line-height:1.8}.company-text-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;margin-top:1.25rem;color:var(--primary-700);font-size:var(--text-sm);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}.company-text-link span{color:var(--brand-teal)}.company-hero-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:2rem;margin-top:clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem);padding:1.15rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}.company-hero-foot>span,.company-hero-foot p{margin:0;color:var(--color-text-subtle);font:500 .62rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.1em}.company-hero-foot p{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;color:var(--primary-800)}.company-hero-foot i{width:1.8rem;height:1px;background:var(--brand-teal)}
.company-section{padding:clamp(4.5rem,8vw,7.5rem) 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border-subtle)}.company-founder-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.55fr 1.45fr;gap:clamp(2rem,8vw,9rem)}.company-section-label>span{display:block;margin-top:3rem;color:var(--color-text-subtle);font:500 .8rem/1.7 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.03em}.company-section-copy{max-width:54rem}.company-role{margin:0 0 1rem;color:var(--primary-700);font:500 .65rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.12em}.company-section-copy h2{margin-bottom:1.5rem}.company-section-copy>p:not(.company-role){max-width:48rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.85}.company-section-copy>p+p{margin-top:1rem}.company-editorial-note{display:block;margin-top:1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-subtle);font-size:var(--text-xs);line-height:1.6}
.company-why{background:var(--color-surface-subtle)}.company-two-column{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:clamp(2rem,8vw,8rem);align-items:start}.company-body-copy{max-width:42rem}.company-body-copy p+p{margin-top:1.2rem}.company-pullquote{margin-top:2rem!important;padding:1.2rem 0 1.2rem 1.4rem;border-left:2px solid var(--brand-teal);color:var(--color-text)!important;font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2vw,1.7rem)!important;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5!important}
.company-section-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .7fr;gap:3rem;align-items:end}.company-section-heading>p{max-width:28rem;margin:0;color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8}.company-belief-list{margin-top:3.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}.company-belief{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(15rem,.85fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:3rem;padding:1.55rem .1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}.company-belief h3{margin:0;color:var(--color-text);font-size:clamp(1.1rem,1.8vw,1.4rem);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.025em}.company-belief p{max-width:42rem;margin:0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.75}
.company-culture{background:var(--color-surface-raised)}.company-practice-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.2rem;margin-top:3.5rem;color:var(--primary-700);font:500 .58rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.1em}.company-practice-line i{height:1px;flex:1;background:var(--color-border)}
.company-future{background:var(--color-surface-subtle)}.company-body-copy strong{display:block;margin-top:1.5rem;color:var(--primary-700);font-size:1.1rem}
.company-today{background:var(--color-surface-raised)}.company-today-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:clamp(2rem,8vw,8rem);align-items:center}.company-today-grid>div>p:not(.company-eyebrow){max-width:40rem}.company-cuevo-feature{min-height:22rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,3rem);border:1px solid var(--color-border);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f3f9fc 0%,#e8f4f6 100%);color:var(--color-text);text-decoration:none;transition:background var(--transition-base),border-color var(--transition-base)}.company-cuevo-feature:hover{border-color:var(--brand-teal);background:#eaf6f7}.company-cuevo-overline{color:var(--primary-700);font:500 .6rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.13em}.company-cuevo-feature strong{font:800 clamp(4rem,9vw,8rem)/.95 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--brand-blue)}.company-cuevo-rule{width:100%;height:1px;background:var(--color-border)}.company-cuevo-caption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.85rem}.company-cuevo-caption b{color:var(--primary-700);font-weight:400}
.company-closing{padding:clamp(4.5rem,8vw,7.5rem) 0;background:var(--color-surface-subtle);border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}.company-closing-inner{max-width:var(--container-standard)}.company-closing h2{font-size:clamp(3rem,6.4vw,6.3rem)}.company-closing-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:3rem;margin-top:2.5rem}.company-closing-bottom>p{max-width:32rem;margin:0;color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8}.company-closing-bottom>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.company-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.9rem;padding:.85rem 1.15rem;border:1px solid var(--primary-700);color:var(--primary-800);font-size:var(--text-sm);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:background var(--transition-interactive),color var(--transition-interactive)}.company-button:hover{background:var(--primary-700);color:#fff}.company-closing-bottom .company-text-link{margin-top:0}
@media(max-width:800px){.company-hero-grid,.company-two-column,.company-section-heading,.company-founder-grid,.company-today-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.company-hero-aside{max-width:38rem}.company-section-label>span{margin-top:0}.company-closing-bottom{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}
@media(max-width:560px){.company-wrap{width:calc(100% - 2rem)}.company-hero{padding-top:4rem}.company-overview h1{font-size:clamp(3.2rem,15vw,5rem)}.company-overview h2{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,10vw,3.5rem)}.company-hero-foot{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:.8rem;margin-top:3rem}.company-hero-foot p{gap:.6rem;font-size:.52rem}.company-belief{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.5rem}.company-practice-line{align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.7rem;font-size:.5rem}.company-practice-line i{flex:1 0 1rem}.company-cuevo-feature{min-height:17rem}.company-section{padding:4.25rem 0}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.company-overview *{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}
</style>
